WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:05.920
<b>The Eminence in Shadow</b>

00:38.250 --> 00:43.290
<b>There has been no conspicuous activity by the
Cult of Diablos in the Midgar Kingdom</b>

00:43.290 --> 00:45.170
<b>since the incident at the Bushin Festival.</b>

00:45.580 --> 00:47.500
<b>The smaller sects were already at a standstill,</b>

00:47.500 --> 00:49.540
<b>and now the Fenrir sect,
which was in the process of restructuring,</b>

00:49.540 --> 00:51.630
<b>appears to be immobilized by the confusion, as well.</b>

00:52.250 --> 00:54.830
<b>It is all going exactly to your plan, My Lord.</b>

00:55.000 --> 00:57.500
<b>Now we can set our sights forward</b>

00:57.500 --> 01:00.830
<b>and focus our main efforts on
the situation in the Oriana Kingdom.</b>

01:01.290 --> 01:03.540
<b>But there is a troubling bit of news.</b>

01:03.880 --> 01:08.580
<b>There has been a recent acceleration in
the flow of funds going into the Lawless City.</b>

01:08.830 --> 01:10.040
<b>Funds?</b>

01:11.380 --> 01:14.130
<b>That region doesn't belong to any nation.</b>

01:14.130 --> 01:18.000
<b>It's a giant slum where the evil, wealth,
and power of the world converge.</b>

01:18.500 --> 01:23.540
<b>Any tensions that occur in that region could have
an immeasurable effect on the rest of society.</b>

01:24.000 --> 01:27.210
<b>Although we would like to focus all of our efforts
on accomplishing our plan,</b>

01:27.210 --> 01:30.420
<b>unfortunately, I must suggest that we dispatch
additional personnel to immediately-</b>

01:30.420 --> 01:31.630
<b>I smell it.</b>

01:33.130 --> 01:34.540
<b>The Lawless City...</b>

01:35.130 --> 01:36.420
<b>reeks of blood.</b>

01:37.420 --> 01:38.880
<b>A storm is brewing.</b>

01:40.580 --> 01:42.290
<b>A storm of blood.</b>

01:48.040 --> 01:49.250
<b>The moon...</b>

01:49.250 --> 01:50.710
<b>It's unusually...</b>

01:51.040 --> 01:52.040
<b>Red.</b>

01:52.040 --> 01:54.630
<b>In fact, it looks just like the legendary...</b>

01:55.000 --> 01:56.380
<b>Red Moon.</b>

01:58.500 --> 02:00.540
<b>The tragedy of a thousand years ago...</b>

02:00.540 --> 02:02.500
<b>In that case, the Lawless City will...</b>

02:02.500 --> 02:06.420
<b>No, if nothing is done, all surrounding nations
will be subjected to catastrophic damage.</b>

02:06.420 --> 02:07.790
<b>Silence, all of you.</b>

02:09.580 --> 02:12.460
<b>If that is an omen of the Red Moon,</b>

02:12.460 --> 02:15.500
<b>we cannot merely sit here and gaze idly at the sky.</b>

02:15.670 --> 02:16.670
<b>We Seven Shadows will-</b>

02:16.670 --> 02:17.670
<b>No.</b>

02:18.250 --> 02:19.460
<b>Let me handle the money-</b>

02:19.630 --> 02:21.130
<b>I mean, this matter.</b>

02:21.380 --> 02:23.880
<b>No! You intend to go there alone?</b>

02:23.880 --> 02:25.130
<b>You object?</b>

02:25.130 --> 02:28.880
<b>We understand that that would be
the surest method, but...</b>

02:28.880 --> 02:31.750
<b>Should the unthinkable happen to you, we would...</b>

02:31.750 --> 02:32.960
<b>Fear not.</b>

02:35.290 --> 02:37.920
<b>The moon has turned red, that is all.</b>

02:38.540 --> 02:39.750
<b>Is it not?</b>

02:42.710 --> 02:44.710
<b>No more than a moon turned red.</b>

02:44.710 --> 02:48.420
<b>Faced with you, even the legendary Red Moon
is stripped of its dignity.</b>

02:49.830 --> 02:53.290
<b>Do you not find the moon to be
just as beautiful when red?</b>

02:56.000 --> 03:00.710
<b>It is because we have you, My Lord,
that we, too, are able to see its beauty.</b>

03:01.000 --> 03:02.750
<b>We wish you the best of luck in battle.</b>

03:03.130 --> 03:03.540
<b>At first, it was nothing more than an ordinary moon,</b>

03:03.540 --> 03:05.750
<b>Your will be done in all things, My Lord.
</b><b>At first, it was nothing more than an ordinary moon,</b><b></b>

03:05.750 --> 03:07.210
<b>I'll analyze some dragon tears or something
</b><b>practically unchanged, but with just a hint of red.</b><b></b>

03:07.210 --> 03:08.250
<b>while I await your return.
</b><b>practically unchanged, but with just a hint of red.</b><b></b>

03:08.250 --> 03:11.670
<b>And so no one knew that it was a portent, a harbinger,
of the revival of the Blood Queen.</b>

03:11.670 --> 03:13.880
<b>No one, save for the Great Shadow!</b>

03:14.920 --> 03:17.210
<b><i>Get these girls involved,</i></b>

03:17.210 --> 03:19.670
<b><i>and the legendary Red Moon
comes to life in the blink of an eye.</i></b>

03:20.040 --> 03:23.130
<b><i>Seriously, their ad-libbing skills are
totally worthy of an Academy award.</i></b>

03:23.790 --> 03:26.460
<b><i>It's just a kind of reddish moon, no big.</i></b>

03:30.130 --> 03:34.880
<b>#1: The Lawless City</b>

03:32.710 --> 03:34.540
<b>So, this is it.</b>

03:34.540 --> 03:35.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:35.540 --> 03:39.000
<b>The Crimson Tower, ruled by the Blood Queen,</b>

03:39.000 --> 03:41.670
<b>one of the three rulers of the Lawless City.</b>

03:41.670 --> 03:43.880
<b>A castle of vampires, eh?</b>

03:44.210 --> 03:45.210
<b>Look at that.</b>

03:45.210 --> 03:48.380
<b>Not even the corpse-raiding vultures
dare to get near it.</b>

03:48.380 --> 03:52.250
<b>They think if they get too close, it's all over.
They'll end up as hideous ghouls.</b>

03:52.420 --> 03:53.710
<b>What, are you scared?</b>

03:53.710 --> 03:54.920
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

03:54.920 --> 03:57.080
<b>It's just a hangout for a bunch of shut-ins.</b>

03:57.080 --> 03:58.540
<b>With the power of Goldy Gilded the Ever-Vict-</b>

04:00.830 --> 04:04.420
<b>You vermin aren't worthy to pass through this gate.</b>

04:04.960 --> 04:11.750
<b>The only ones authorized are servants or guests
of the Blood Queen, and powerful warriors.</b>

04:14.250 --> 04:18.210
<b>I get it, and you're right,
we're not servants or guests.</b>

04:18.210 --> 04:21.750
<b>We are powerful warriors,
here to hunt the Blood Queen!</b>

04:24.710 --> 04:25.920
<b>What's so funny?</b>

04:26.000 --> 04:28.830
<b>I thought I was a fool,</b>

04:28.830 --> 04:33.210
<b>which is why it's always so amusing
to find someone more foolish than I am.</b>

04:34.040 --> 04:37.630
<b>This is what happens to fools
who dare challenge the Blood Queen!</b>

04:37.630 --> 04:42.380
<b>I lost my right arm, and now I'm kept here
as a pathetic watchdog on a leash.</b>

04:43.750 --> 04:46.750
<b>We're not small potatoes like you.</b>

04:46.750 --> 04:48.960
<b>Here's something you can think about in the afterlife:</b>

04:48.960 --> 04:52.380
<b>My power level is 4,317.5!</b>

04:52.380 --> 04:57.170
<b>I was like you once.
They called me the White Devil.</b>

04:58.750 --> 05:00.000
<b>The White Devil?</b>

05:00.000 --> 05:02.460
<b>The wanted criminal with the
huge bounty on his head?</b>

05:02.670 --> 05:05.630
<b>But here, I'm nothing more than a lowly watchdog!</b>

05:05.630 --> 05:09.420
<b>Ripping apart idiots like you
who don't know their place</b>

05:09.420 --> 05:12.250
<b>is the only joy I have left in life!</b>

05:13.290 --> 05:14.290
<b>Here he comes!</b>

05:14.290 --> 05:15.290
<b>Right!</b>

05:28.420 --> 05:30.670
<b><i>Yes, this is perfect!</i></b>

05:30.670 --> 05:34.670
<b><i>The Lawless City is even more of a dump
than I imagined!</i></b>

05:34.670 --> 05:36.170
<b>Stop gawking.</b>

05:36.880 --> 05:39.130
<b>You don't want to catch the attention of any weirdos.</b>

05:39.130 --> 05:40.540
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

05:41.540 --> 05:42.540
<b>Hey...</b>

05:42.540 --> 05:43.750
<b>What?</b>

05:44.040 --> 05:45.710
<b>Aren't we going to that tower?</b>

05:46.000 --> 05:47.580
<b>You are so...</b>

05:48.330 --> 05:51.130
<b>First, I'm going to the Dark Knight Association
for a strategy meeting.</b>

05:51.130 --> 05:52.630
<b>Dark Knight Association?</b>

05:52.630 --> 05:54.330
<b>Never saw any of those back home.</b>

05:54.330 --> 05:56.330
<b>Because we have our own Knight Order.</b>

05:56.460 --> 05:58.960
<b>The Dark Knight Association is
an unofficial organization</b>

05:58.960 --> 06:01.790
<b>founded for Dark Knights that don't
belong to any public institutions.</b>

06:01.790 --> 06:03.580
<b><i>The summer of my last year of high school...
</i></b><b>When a government or landowner cannot cover...</b><b></b>

06:03.580 --> 06:07.420
<b><i>I, Minoru Kageno, was following the road to
becoming the Eminence in Shadow,</i></b>

06:03.580 --> 06:10.250
<b>Deceased   MINORU KAGENO (18)</b>

06:07.420 --> 06:09.460
<b><i>when my journey came to an abrupt end.</i></b>

06:10.500 --> 06:11.710
<b><i>Or so it seemed.</i></b>

06:11.710 --> 06:16.500
<b><i>But after one thing and another,
this stuff turned into that...</i></b>

06:17.000 --> 06:18.960
<b><i>And that, I don't even know...</i></b>

06:19.380 --> 06:20.920
<b><i>This, this, and that were all like this...</i></b>

06:20.920 --> 06:22.460
<b><i>And it was kind of like this...</i></b>

06:22.790 --> 06:25.960
<b><i>Then all this happened, aaand...</i></b>

06:26.130 --> 06:27.130
<b><i>Here we are.</i></b>

06:27.130 --> 06:28.130
<b>And that's it!</b>

06:28.670 --> 06:31.040
<b>Imatry Nottaloos is down for the count!</b>

06:31.250 --> 06:32.540
<b>And the winner is...</b>

06:33.170 --> 06:34.630
<b>Claire Kagenou!</b>

06:35.880 --> 06:38.380
<b><i>My sister won the Bushin Festival championship.</i></b>

06:39.000 --> 06:43.880
<b><i>To celebrate, I used my connections with Gamma
and got dressed up for a free...</i></b>

06:44.170 --> 06:48.170
<b><i>Excuse me, I mean high-end, fancy dinner
at a Mitsugoshi restaurant, but...</i></b>

06:48.330 --> 06:51.580
<b>I'm going to the Lawless City to exterminate vampires.</b>

06:52.170 --> 06:54.330
<b><i>The tournament ended and
she headed right off to battle.</i></b>

06:54.330 --> 06:55.630
<b><i>I know she's my sister,</i></b>

06:55.630 --> 06:57.960
<b><i>but even I wonder how she can be so hot-blooded.</i></b>

07:00.580 --> 07:04.130
<b>I brought you here with me out of consideration
for your future, you know.</b>

07:04.130 --> 07:05.330
<b>My future?</b>

07:05.330 --> 07:08.040
<b>If you stay behind me and do everything I say,</b>

07:08.040 --> 07:11.290
<b>I'll pry open a spot for you in
Midgar's Knight Order after you graduate.</b>

07:11.290 --> 07:12.420
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

07:12.540 --> 07:15.080
<b><i>So she's trying bulk up my resume
to make me a government employee.</i></b>

07:15.080 --> 07:18.960
<b><i>Come to think of it, I haven't really considered
what I'll do after I graduate.</i></b>

07:19.420 --> 07:21.460
<b><i>Claire will inherit the estate out in the boondocks,</i></b>

07:21.460 --> 07:25.080
<b><i>so I think they'll stick me
in some kind of job somewhere.</i></b>

07:25.540 --> 07:29.170
<b>As long as I can do what I want to do,
I don't think I care what kind of a job I end up in.</b>

07:29.170 --> 07:31.170
<b>And what is it that you want to do?</b>

07:31.170 --> 07:32.380
<b>A secret.</b>

07:32.380 --> 07:35.920
<b>I make it a point not to tell anyone the
things that really matter to me.</b>

07:35.920 --> 07:37.460
<b>You're just making that up.</b>

07:37.880 --> 07:40.670
<b>Stop trying to cover up the fact that
you just haven't thought about it.</b>

07:40.670 --> 07:42.290
<b>Why do you assume that?</b>

07:42.580 --> 07:43.790
<b>Whatever, it's fine.</b>

07:44.330 --> 07:45.540
<b>No, it's not.</b>

07:46.750 --> 07:48.130
<b>It's not fine.</b>

07:50.880 --> 07:53.750
<b>Hello there!
Come take a look, my beautiful young lady!</b>

07:54.130 --> 07:56.040
<b>I just got a new stock of high-quality pets!</b>

07:57.710 --> 07:58.710
<b>You mean me?</b>

07:58.710 --> 08:00.080
<b>Yes, I mean you!</b>

08:00.080 --> 08:02.130
<b>The most beautiful young lady in the world!</b>

08:02.670 --> 08:03.960
<b>You have a good eye.</b>

08:03.960 --> 08:05.580
<b>He's buttering you up, Sis.</b>

08:05.580 --> 08:06.790
<b>You be quiet.</b>

08:07.170 --> 08:08.960
<b>But please, come look, miss!</b>

08:08.960 --> 08:11.540
<b>These lucky finds just came in this morning!</b>

08:11.540 --> 08:13.330
<b>This is today's hot item!</b>

08:13.330 --> 08:15.670
<b>The pet Dark Knight, Little Goldy!</b>

08:16.210 --> 08:17.210
<b>What do you say?</b>

08:17.210 --> 08:19.830
<b>He's quite the handsome specimen,
a perfect fit for such a lovely lady.</b>

08:19.830 --> 08:21.210
<b>He's all beat up.</b>

08:21.210 --> 08:23.580
<b>Can't you at least handle
your products more carefully?</b>

08:24.330 --> 08:27.380
<b>I guess he did get a little banged up in transit.</b>

08:27.750 --> 08:29.830
<b>All right, he's worth 30 million zeni,</b>

08:29.830 --> 08:31.210
<b>but I'll let you have him for 27.</b>

08:31.210 --> 08:32.630
<b>He looks kind of familiar...
</b><b>but I'll let you have him for 27.</b><b></b>

08:32.630 --> 08:33.830
<b>It's a little steep.</b>

08:33.830 --> 08:35.290
<b>Okay, I get it.</b>

08:35.290 --> 08:37.540
<b>In that case, I'll give you a special deal,
and throw in this little guy!</b>

08:37.540 --> 08:40.210
<b>Another fresh new catch, Cue Ball Quinton!</b>

08:40.210 --> 08:42.380
<b>Whaddaya say?
Two pets for the low price of 40 million zeni!</b>

08:42.380 --> 08:44.330
<b>You can't possibly say no to that!</b>

08:44.330 --> 08:45.830
<b>He's been sliced through the middle.</b>

08:47.000 --> 08:49.380
<b>Okay, okay!
37 million zeni!</b>

08:49.380 --> 08:50.880
<b>I can't go any lower than that!</b>

08:50.880 --> 08:51.880
<b>Not interested.</b>

08:51.880 --> 08:53.920
<b>I've seen him somewhere before...
</b><b>Wow, you drive a hard bargain!</b><b></b>

08:53.920 --> 08:56.670
<b>All right, I'll let you have 'em for 35 million!</b>

08:56.830 --> 08:58.170
<b>I'm sorry, but...</b>

08:58.580 --> 09:00.290
<b>I have all the pets I need.</b>

09:00.290 --> 09:02.540
<b>I see, so you prefer younger pups.</b>

09:02.540 --> 09:03.920
<b>In that case, I think I'm expecting a
Dark Knight Academy student deep in debt...</b>

09:03.920 --> 09:06.330
<b>Come on, we're walking.
</b><b>In that case, I think I'm expecting a</b><b>
</b><b>Dark Knight Academy student deep in debt...</b><b></b>

09:06.330 --> 09:08.830
<b>I can't walk when you're dragging me.
</b><b>I think it was Skull, or Skinny...</b><b></b>

09:08.830 --> 09:09.290
<b>If I don't keep a hand on you, you'll get lost.
</b><b>I think it was Skull, or Skinny...</b><b></b>

09:09.290 --> 09:11.500
<b>If I don't keep a hand on you, you'll get lost.</b>

09:11.580 --> 09:12.580
<b>No, I won't.</b>

09:12.580 --> 09:13.580
<b>Yes, you will.</b>

09:13.580 --> 09:14.880
<b>No, I will not.</b>

09:14.880 --> 09:16.670
<b>I know for a fact you will.</b>

09:17.290 --> 09:18.290
<b>I did.</b>

09:21.380 --> 09:25.670
<b>I just came out for a minute
because I was bored at the inn.</b>

09:26.710 --> 09:28.330
<b>Oops, sorry.</b>

09:31.420 --> 09:33.420
<b>And that's what we call karma.</b>

09:36.130 --> 09:37.420
<b>Coming through.</b>

09:42.880 --> 09:44.250
<b>Sorry about that, kid.</b>

09:44.630 --> 09:46.500
<b>You need to be getting home, little boy.</b>

09:46.790 --> 09:48.130
<b>Thanks for doing business!</b>

09:50.500 --> 09:52.880
<b><i>It's always been a dog eat dog world.</i></b>

09:52.880 --> 09:55.420
<b><i>I can't believe I'm getting money
just by taking a stroll.</i></b>

09:55.420 --> 09:57.920
<b><i>This city is heaven for me.</i></b>

09:58.670 --> 10:00.880
<b>Now you've really done it, punk!</b>

10:03.330 --> 10:04.960
<b>How are you gonna make it up to us, huh?!</b>

10:04.960 --> 10:07.080
<b>I'm in a bad enough mood already!</b>

10:07.080 --> 10:09.710
<b>I lost my bet, my dear sweet Marie turned me down,</b>

10:09.710 --> 10:11.670
<b>and it's all your fault!</b>

10:12.080 --> 10:13.630
<b><i>So, that's a ghoul...
</i></b><b>You rotten little-</b><b></b>

10:13.630 --> 10:15.250
<b><i>a vampire underling.</i></b>

10:15.540 --> 10:18.000
<b><i>I've heard they have, like, a lot of HP,</i></b>

10:18.000 --> 10:20.540
<b><i>but I guess around here,
they're just everyone's punching bags.</i></b>

10:20.880 --> 10:22.630
<b><i>It really is a dog eat dog world.</i></b>

10:22.630 --> 10:26.000
<b><i>Just what I'd expect from the Lawless City,
a town drenched in blood and slaughter.</i></b>

10:40.880 --> 10:42.540
<b><i>A wave of magical energy?</i></b>

10:45.170 --> 10:46.460
<b>H-hey!</b>

10:46.460 --> 10:48.830
<b>This thing was still alive?!</b>

11:01.080 --> 11:03.710
<b><i>A human bitten by a ghoul
turns into a ghoul themself.</i></b>

11:03.710 --> 11:09.380
<b><i>Apparently, that was only a rumor,
when actually...</i></b>

11:12.710 --> 11:14.040
<b><i>Oh, is that why?</i></b>

11:14.250 --> 11:17.670
<b><i>The red moon is stimulating all
the magical energy in town.</i></b>

11:18.210 --> 11:20.880
<b>Looks like if I don't do anything,
they'll just keep multiplying.</b>

11:21.580 --> 11:22.880
<b>What to do?</b>

11:22.880 --> 11:25.250
<b>Do I run away like a background character as usual?</b>

11:25.250 --> 11:27.460
<b>Or do I say what happens in the Lawless City
stays in the Lawless City,</b>

11:27.460 --> 11:30.250
<b>and try the mysterious young man act?</b>

11:34.210 --> 11:37.540
<b>Anyway, since I do get to be
in a zombie apocalypse,</b>

11:37.540 --> 11:40.630
<b>I think I'll let things get a little bit
more out of hand before I...</b>

11:40.630 --> 11:41.830
<b>Get down!</b>

11:55.080 --> 11:56.290
<b>You are?</b>

11:56.880 --> 11:58.460
<b>I am Mary...</b>

11:59.000 --> 12:00.920
<b>the Ancient Vampire Hunter.</b>

12:01.750 --> 12:02.960
<b>"Ancient"?</b>

12:03.750 --> 12:05.580
<b>Run, if you value your life.</b>

12:06.040 --> 12:08.830
<b>"Run, if you value your life"...</b>

12:10.080 --> 12:11.920
<b>The frenzy has begun.</b>

12:12.290 --> 12:14.460
<b>"The frenzy has begun!"</b>

12:15.080 --> 12:16.290
<b>The moon is red.</b>

12:16.580 --> 12:18.500
<b>We are out of time.</b>

12:20.000 --> 12:22.420
<b>"We're out of time."</b>

12:23.630 --> 12:26.130
<b><i>What is happening?</i></b>

12:26.750 --> 12:28.080
<b><i>What is this feeling?</i></b>

12:28.960 --> 12:30.750
<b><i>This thrill in my heart?</i></b>

12:31.670 --> 12:32.880
<b><i>This is...</i></b>

12:35.920 --> 12:37.130
<b><i>This is...</i></b>

12:41.580 --> 12:43.670
<b>Did he not hear me?</b>

12:44.330 --> 12:46.630
<b>I told him to be a good boy and wait at the inn.</b>

12:58.000 --> 12:59.580
<b>I-I'm saved...</b>

12:59.580 --> 13:00.580
<b>Hey, you.</b>

13:00.830 --> 13:03.960
<b>Have you seen a boy
with black hair and black eyes?</b>

13:03.960 --> 13:05.830
<b>N-no, I haven't!</b>

13:06.750 --> 13:07.750
<b>Oh.</b>

13:09.210 --> 13:12.000
<b>Where did that idiot wander off to?</b>

13:24.460 --> 13:27.330
<b>O-o-our time has come, Po!</b>

13:27.330 --> 13:28.330
<b>It has!</b>

13:28.330 --> 13:31.750
<b>Th-th-the academy will never find us here!
They can't possibly expel us!</b>

13:31.750 --> 13:36.000
<b>It was s-s-so worth risking our lives to come here!</b>

13:36.210 --> 13:38.290
<b>Our summer may be over!</b>

13:38.290 --> 13:41.500
<b>But our virginity is still going strong, my dear Skel!</b>

13:41.500 --> 13:42.500
<b>You got that right!</b>

13:42.500 --> 13:44.670
<b>When will we ever become real adults?!</b>

13:44.670 --> 13:46.130
<b>Now, of course!</b>

13:46.130 --> 13:47.460
<b>Into the splendor...</b>

13:47.460 --> 13:49.580
<b>...of the world of maturity!</b>

13:50.250 --> 13:51.880
<b>Let's go!</b>

13:52.790 --> 13:53.790
<b>What was that for?!</b>

13:53.790 --> 13:55.670
<b>You are way too excited!</b>

14:05.500 --> 14:07.500
<b>That dirty old man...</b>

14:12.040 --> 14:14.080
<b>How long will this go on?</b>

14:17.170 --> 14:19.330
<b>What now?
Another street fight?</b>

14:20.290 --> 14:22.630
<b>I'm trying to wallow in misery here.</b>

14:29.960 --> 14:31.250
<b>Who's there?</b>

14:31.250 --> 14:32.920
<b>I'm not taking any more customers today...</b>

14:47.000 --> 14:48.880
<b>Run, if you value your life.</b>

14:51.000 --> 14:52.500
<b>The frenzy has begun.</b>

14:53.170 --> 14:54.380
<b>Frenzy?</b>

14:55.080 --> 14:56.540
<b>The moon is red.</b>

14:57.960 --> 14:59.380
<b>We're out of time.</b>

15:02.130 --> 15:03.500
<b>W-wait!</b>

15:03.500 --> 15:04.920
<b>Wh-who are you?</b>

15:05.380 --> 15:06.380
<b>Shadow.</b>

15:06.710 --> 15:08.580
<b>Run, if you value your life.</b>

15:09.130 --> 15:10.540
<b>The frenzy has begun.</b>

15:17.330 --> 15:18.630
<b>The moon is red.</b>

15:19.130 --> 15:20.670
<b>We're out of time.</b>

15:25.670 --> 15:27.500
<b>Marie! Marie, are you okay?</b>

15:27.500 --> 15:29.040
<b>There are ghouls outside, and-</b>

15:29.880 --> 15:31.250
<b>What happened in here?</b>

15:31.460 --> 15:34.630
<b>Well, a man named Shadow...</b>

15:35.080 --> 15:36.290
<b>Shadow?</b>

15:36.290 --> 15:37.540
<b>You mean the Shadow?</b>

15:37.540 --> 15:38.830
<b>You've heard of him?</b>

15:38.830 --> 15:42.250
<b>He's the evil mastermind who had a field day
beating up the corrupt clergy!</b>

15:42.250 --> 15:45.040
<b>He's at least as dangerous as
any of the rulers of this city!</b>

15:49.290 --> 15:50.500
<b>But he...</b>

15:51.210 --> 15:53.130
<b>He couldn't be a bad man.</b>

15:59.210 --> 16:00.710
<b>Marie? What are you doing?</b>

16:00.710 --> 16:03.250
<b>I'm getting out of this crazy, messed-up town.</b>

16:03.250 --> 16:04.630
<b>You're breaking your contract?</b>

16:04.630 --> 16:06.330
<b>But who knows what they'll do if they find you!</b>

16:06.790 --> 16:08.710
<b>Thank you, Shadow.</b>

16:12.210 --> 16:14.290
<b>Try to escape, if you so desire.</b>

16:14.750 --> 16:18.170
<b>If you are fortunate,
you may even be successful in your attempt.</b>

16:19.580 --> 16:23.880
<b>Of course, the past is never so kind
as to let anyone go.</b>

16:25.630 --> 16:26.630
<b>Lady Yukime!</b>

16:26.630 --> 16:28.380
<b>The vampires have set ghouls loose in the city!</b>

16:37.290 --> 16:38.830
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

16:38.830 --> 16:40.290
<b>I'm so sorry, Cid.</b>

16:41.040 --> 16:43.710
<b>If only I hadn't brought you to this horrible place...</b>

16:44.830 --> 16:49.380
<b>Are you the woman going around asking
about a boy with black hair and black eyes?</b>

16:49.670 --> 16:51.250
<b>I met one not long ago.</b>

16:51.500 --> 16:52.880
<b>I've already found him.</b>

16:54.420 --> 16:55.710
<b>He's my brother.</b>

16:55.710 --> 16:57.500
<b>But I've found him now.</b>

16:58.750 --> 17:01.080
<b>That boy doesn't have black hair or black eyes.</b>

17:01.500 --> 17:02.500
<b>What?</b>

17:04.250 --> 17:05.670
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

17:05.880 --> 17:08.540
<b>I met two men who match the description.</b>

17:08.540 --> 17:09.750
<b>Tell me!</b>

17:10.130 --> 17:12.920
<b>I saw the first one when the moon
was beginning to turn red.</b>

17:13.290 --> 17:15.830
<b>He was standing in front of
a rampaging ghoul and smiling.</b>

17:15.830 --> 17:16.830
<b>That's not him.</b>

17:16.830 --> 17:19.790
<b>My brother may scream, but he would never smile.</b>

17:20.080 --> 17:22.040
<b>I saw the second one a few minutes ago.</b>

17:22.330 --> 17:24.830
<b>He was a young Dark Knight with
no noticeable features.</b>

17:24.830 --> 17:26.500
<b>Where was he?!
Tell me!</b>

17:27.000 --> 17:30.130
<b>He was about to be taken away by the
followers of the Blood Queen.</b>

17:30.330 --> 17:31.540
<b>The Blood...</b>

17:31.670 --> 17:33.500
<b>They took him away?
Where?</b>

17:36.040 --> 17:37.420
<b>The Crimson Tower?</b>

17:37.420 --> 17:41.420
<b>Your brother is in the Crimson Tower,
the Blood Queen's castle.</b>

17:41.880 --> 17:46.080
<b>The vampires wish to offer him as a sacrifice
to the Blood Queen.</b>

17:46.500 --> 17:47.540
<b>Sacrifice?</b>

17:47.540 --> 17:51.880
<b>To awaken Blood Queen Elisabeth
from her thousand-year slumber,</b>

17:51.880 --> 17:54.250
<b>they require the blood of a living young man.</b>

17:54.250 --> 17:55.250
<b>Wait.</b>

17:55.380 --> 17:57.790
<b>What's this about the Blood Queen being asleep?
That's news.</b>

17:57.790 --> 18:00.330
<b>They've kept that fact secret, biding their time.</b>

18:00.670 --> 18:02.170
<b>Waiting a thousand years,</b>

18:02.170 --> 18:05.330
<b>for the night that would give the vampires
tremendous power...</b>

18:06.080 --> 18:08.790
<b>The night the Red Moon would rise again.</b>

18:09.210 --> 18:12.040
<b>It's true, the moon has seemed redder
these last few days.</b>

18:12.540 --> 18:15.790
<b>The Red Moon affects the sleeping queen, as well.</b>

18:16.080 --> 18:19.250
<b>With the sacrifice's blood as a catalyst,
she will surely...</b>

18:23.080 --> 18:25.290
<b>But the point is, Cid is in the tower, right?</b>

18:25.540 --> 18:28.000
<b>And if they need blood of the living,
then he's still alive.</b>

18:28.580 --> 18:31.710
<b>My target is is the Blood Queen Elisabeth.</b>

18:31.710 --> 18:33.750
<b>To find her, I must go to the Crimson Tower.</b>

18:33.750 --> 18:36.000
<b>Then we're heading in the same direction.</b>

18:36.880 --> 18:39.460
<b>Let's work together, Miss...</b>

18:39.460 --> 18:40.460
<b>Mary.</b>

18:40.830 --> 18:42.460
<b>I am a vampire hunter.</b>

18:42.460 --> 18:44.000
<b>I'm Claire.</b>

18:46.710 --> 18:49.580
<b>It will be difficult to get in from the ground floor,
but there is a way.</b>

18:49.580 --> 18:50.580
<b>Follow me.</b>

18:50.580 --> 18:51.580
<b>Got it!</b>

18:51.580 --> 18:52.960
<b>I'm coming for you, Cid!</b>

19:00.130 --> 19:01.130
<b>We're dead!
We're gonna die!</b>

19:01.130 --> 19:02.500
<b>We're gonna die virgins!</b>

19:02.500 --> 19:03.540
<b>You gotta be kidding!</b>

19:03.540 --> 19:05.960
<b>Other than my mom,
I've never even kissed a-</b>

19:06.790 --> 19:09.500
<b>Skel, my friend!
I'll never forget your virginity!</b>

19:09.500 --> 19:11.540
<b>Hey, wait up!
Don't abandon me here!</b>

19:12.250 --> 19:13.790
<b>B-boobs!</b>

19:17.830 --> 19:20.250
<b>J-Juggernaut, boss, sir?</b>

19:20.250 --> 19:22.130
<b>I love it, don't you?</b>

19:22.710 --> 19:24.960
<b>It smells like a nice, big battle.</b>

19:24.960 --> 19:28.880
<b>We haven't seen one like this
since the therianthrope invasion way back when.</b>

19:29.580 --> 19:31.170
<b>Now's our chance!
Retreat!</b>

19:31.170 --> 19:32.920
<b>Run across the rooftops to the station!</b>

19:32.920 --> 19:34.750
<b>What do you think you're doing?</b>

19:34.750 --> 19:36.790
<b>And you call yourself Association Knights?</b>

19:36.790 --> 19:39.080
<b>I don't give a damn about your association's honor!</b>

19:39.330 --> 19:40.710
<b>They don't pay us enough for this!</b>

19:40.710 --> 19:41.920
<b>Forget it!</b>

19:42.460 --> 19:44.750
<b>Those lousy scavengers...</b>

19:44.750 --> 19:47.210
<b>Director, we can't hold the main street any longer!</b>

19:49.380 --> 19:50.710
<b>They made it this far?</b>

19:58.540 --> 20:00.420
<b>Run, if you value your life.</b>

20:02.420 --> 20:03.920
<b>The frenzy has begun.</b>

20:04.790 --> 20:06.000
<b>Who are you?</b>

20:06.210 --> 20:08.420
<b>H-he's the wanted criminal!</b>

20:09.460 --> 20:10.750
<b>The moon is red.</b>

20:11.580 --> 20:13.000
<b>We're out of time.</b>

20:13.750 --> 20:15.880
<b>We have little time remaining.</b>

20:17.380 --> 20:18.580
<b>Lord Crimson...</b>

20:18.750 --> 20:20.880
<b>Preparations for the sacrifice are almost complete.</b>

20:22.130 --> 20:24.130
<b>And our takeover of the city is going as planned.</b>

20:24.130 --> 20:25.130
<b>However...</b>

20:25.130 --> 20:26.130
<b>However?</b>

20:26.130 --> 20:28.960
<b>We're meeting some unexpected resistance
in certain locations.</b>

20:29.790 --> 20:31.500
<b>We know who's behind that.</b>

20:31.500 --> 20:35.960
<b>The fools who babble on with their nonsensical ideas
that they are my equals:</b>

20:36.210 --> 20:38.920
<b>Yukime the Spirit Fox, ruler of the White Tower.</b>

20:39.250 --> 20:41.630
<b>Juggernaut the Tyrant, ruler of the Black Tower.</b>

20:41.960 --> 20:44.000
<b>Let them play their games.</b>

20:44.250 --> 20:47.750
<b>They will meet their end
as soon as the Blood Queen revives.</b>

20:47.750 --> 20:48.750
<b>Yes, Lord.</b>

20:48.750 --> 20:50.580
<b>Oh, but there is one other...</b>

20:50.580 --> 20:51.580
<b>What?</b>

20:51.960 --> 20:55.880
<b>There is someone going around the city killing ghouls.</b>

20:59.710 --> 21:02.290
<b>Stay out of this, gruntlings!</b>

21:06.750 --> 21:09.420
<b>Go to Hell, she-fox!</b>

21:09.420 --> 21:13.080
<b>You truly are a thorn in my side.</b>

21:15.630 --> 21:19.330
<b>I insist that you cease opening your mouth
and spewing your rancid breath across the city.</b>

21:19.330 --> 21:22.040
<b>You're the one who reeks, animal lady!</b>

21:22.040 --> 21:24.830
<b>I do not care for pushy men!</b>

21:29.790 --> 21:31.290
<b>Nothing changes.</b>

21:32.290 --> 21:38.000
<b>Someone, somewhere,
may be trying to spin a new tale.</b>

21:38.920 --> 21:40.330
<b>But I do not change.</b>

21:41.080 --> 21:44.580
<b>I only continue on my quest to become
the Eminence in Shadow!</b>

21:51.210 --> 21:52.630
<b>Who are you?</b>

21:53.580 --> 21:54.830
<b>You're...</b>

21:55.920 --> 21:57.630
<b>My name is Shadow.</b>

21:59.210 --> 22:00.920
<b>He who lurks in the shadows</b>

22:00.920 --> 22:02.710
<b>in order to hunt the shadows.</b>

22:13.290 --> 22:15.380
<b>That is too late</b>

22:15.380 --> 22:18.290
<b>You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
</b><b>Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai</b><b></b>

22:18.290 --> 22:20.420
<b>That is to say...</b>

22:23.380 --> 22:29.580
<b>The first move chooses an unknown future
</b><b>Saisho no itte de erabu michi naru future</b><b></b>

22:29.580 --> 22:32.250
<b>How it will be
</b><b>Sono arisama</b><b></b>

22:32.250 --> 22:33.380
<b>This way</b>

22:33.380 --> 22:39.670
<b>The last move decides the world's answer
</b><b>Saigo no itte de kimeru sekai no answer</b><b></b>

22:39.670 --> 22:42.290
<b>A single winner
</b><b>Hitori no winner</b><b></b>

22:42.290 --> 22:43.670
<b>It's me</b>

22:43.920 --> 22:46.210
<b>These eyes have seen it
</b><b>Kono me wa misueta</b><b></b>

22:47.710 --> 22:53.290
<b>The optimal solution no one has yet been able to discern
</b><b>Dare mo imada mitoosenu saitekikai o</b><b></b>

22:54.580 --> 22:58.380
<b>It's all a game to control the board
</b><b>Subete wa banjou shihai suru game</b><b></b>

22:58.380 --> 23:00.880
<b>A battle of thought
</b><b>Shikou no tousou</b><b></b>

23:01.040 --> 23:03.420
<b>I disguise even my mistakes
</b><b>Mistake sae mo gisou shite</b><b></b>

23:03.420 --> 23:06.000
<b>And even checkmate is a preparatory move
</b><b>Checkmate made fuseki toshite</b><b></b>

23:06.000 --> 23:08.420
<b>A game to take each other's king
</b><b>King o ubaiau game</b><b></b>

23:08.420 --> 23:10.880
<b>Ideology and desire
</b><b>Shisou to yokubou</b><b></b>

23:11.170 --> 23:13.540
<b>A bad move to not let one chance get away
</b><b>One chance minogasanu akushu</b><b></b>

23:13.540 --> 23:16.250
<b>The last chance will cinch it
</b><b>Last chance kanarazu shitomeru</b><b></b>

23:16.500 --> 23:18.500
<b>That is too late</b>

23:18.500 --> 23:21.420
<b>You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
</b><b>Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai</b><b></b>

23:21.420 --> 23:23.580
<b>That is to say</b>

23:23.580 --> 23:28.540
<b>Total victory is in my hands
</b><b>Kanzen shouri wa kono te no naka ni</b><b></b>

23:33.830 --> 23:36.630
<b>No one can catch up now
</b><b>Dare nimo mou oitsukenai</b><b></b>
